    "description": {
      "value": "<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">You descended from Sardior, the Ruby Heart. Your scales have a pearly shine, invoking the appearance of amethyst, emerald, moonstone, sapphire or topaz. Your alien presence can invoke fear or awe in others: you gain +1 circumstance bonus on @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.OX4fy22hQgUHDr0q]{Make an Impression} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.tHCqgwjtQtzNqVvd]{Coerce} checks.  While you don’t possess wings, you can create spectral, psychic wings for yourself if you select feats that would require wings.</span></p>",
